<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on CITIC.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on CITIC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp;</p>
<p>Co C.V. said on Friday it has issued 150 million American-style</p>
<p>call warrants on shares of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$37.25	 PREMIUM	    13.67 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.765	 GEARING	    5.2X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	13.JAN.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  19.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     20.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$39.50	 MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
